exercise: {a}'s pocket: {q} quarters, {d+1} dimes no wait {d} dimes, {k} nickels, {p} pennies. how much in cents
exercise: {a} reckons a quarter's 20 cents?? nah. {q} quarters {d} dimes {k} nickels {p} pennies, real total in cents
exercise: jar's got {p} pennies, {k} nickels, {d} dimes, {q} quarters — and like 3 buttons lol. how many cents
test: how much money is it if u got {q} quarters {d} dimes {k} nickels and {p} pennies, in cents
